6,"e":29.78,"text":"Gold on the towers, but the children feel guilt."},{"s":29.78,"e":33.44,"text":"Seven red lines on the dashboard glow,"},{"s":33.72,"e":36.96,"text":"Forests fall quiet where the wild things go,"},{"s":36.96,"e":40.2,"text":"Plastic in the river, fire in the rain,"},{"s":40.78,"e":43.62,"text":"Everybody scrolling while the world screams pain."},{"s":43.62,"e":46.9,"text":"But the sun still rises like it’s begging us,"},{"s":46.9,"e":50.3,"text":"The soil still waits for a seed and trust,"},{"s":50.3,"e":53.7,"text":"And the poor don’t need another speech from the stands—"},{"s":53.7,"e":57.32,"text":"They need bread, clean water, and working hands."},{"s":57.32,"e":60.48,"text":"We don’t need another throne,"},{"s":60.48,"e":63.82,"text":"We don’t need another war,"},{"s":63.82,"e":66.54,"text":"We don’t need to sell the future"},{"s":67.06,"e":70.78,"text":"Just to buy a little more."},{"s":71.12,"e":74.18,"text":"Earth is crying, but she ain’t dead,"},{"s":74.18,"e":77.36,"text":"There’s still a crown of stars overhead,"},{"s":77.36,"e":80.94,"text":"If the world is breaking, understand:"},{"s":80.94,"e":82.84,"text":"God gave us hearts,"},{"s":82.84,"e":84.5,"text":"Earth gave us land,"},{"s":91.54,"e":95.88,"text":"Now we still got hands."},{"s":98.94,"e":101.28,"text":"Mothers walk miles for a bucket of clear,"},{"s":101.64,"e":104.8,"text":"Fathers cross borders with a child and fear,"},{"s":105.12,"e":108.12,"text":"Hungry mouths praying where the harvest failed,"},{"s":108.12,"e":111.76,"text":"While the rich build rockets and the truth gets jailed."},{"s":111.9,"e":114.96,"text":"Bombs in the budget, schools in decay,"},{"s":114.96,"e":118.42,"text":"Medicine weaker when the germs don’t play,"},{"s":118.68,"e":121.68,"text":"Air getting heavy, money getting loud,"},{"s":122.02,"e":125.16,"text":"Lonely little people in a digital crowd."},{"s":125.16,"e":128.5,"text":"But a meal can be holy, a roof can be grace,"},{"s":128.5,"e":131.88,"text":"A doctor, a farmer, a safe little place,"},{"s":132.06,"e":135.12,"text":"Peace ain’t soft, it’s a line in the sand—"},{"s":135.12,"e":136.96,"text":"It’s love with a backbone,"},{"s":137.12,"e":138.74,"text":"It’s work with a plan."},{"s":138.68,"e":141.7,"text":"We don’t need another throne,"},{"s":141.7,"e":145.1,"text":"We don’t need another war,"},{"s":145.1,"e":147.72,"text":"We don’t need to sell the future"},{"s":148.3,"e":150.64,"text":"Just to buy a little more."},{"s":152.3,"e":155.34,"text":"Earth is crying, but she ain’t dead,"},{"s":155.34,"e":158.78,"text":"There’s still a crown of stars overhead,"},{"s":158.78,"e":162.02,"text":"If the world is breaking, understand:"},{"s":162.02,"e":163.96,"text":"God gave us hearts,"},{"s":163.96,"e":165.48,"text":"Earth gave us land,"},{"s":165.48,"e":166.92,"text":"Now we still got hands."},{"s":166.84,"e":168.96,"text":"Turn the tanks into tractors,"},{"s":168.96,"e":170.7,"text":"Turn the lies into light,"},{"s":170.7,"e":172.36,"text":"Turn the panic into practice,"},{"s":172.36,"e":174.04,"text":"Turn the rage into rights."},{"s":174.04,"e":175.66,"text":"Plant the trees, feed the block,"},{"s":175.66,"e":177.38,"text":"Clean the water, fix the grid,"},{"s":177.38,"e":179.06,"text":"Tell the kings of endless profit:"},{"s":179.06,"e":180.78,"text":"“We remember every kid.”"},{"s":180.78,"e":182.38,"text":"No more oceans full of ghosts,"},{"s":182.38,"e":184.16,"text":"No more skies we cannot breathe,"},{"s":184.16,"e":185.96,"text":"No more calling it impossible"},{"s":187.12,"e":192.36,"text":"When impossible is greed."},{"s":192.36,"e":194.26,"text":"We don’t need another throne,"},{"s":195.56,"e":198.48,"text":"We don’t need another war,"},{"s":198.48,"e":202.36,"text":"We need mercy in the morning,"},{"s":202.36,"e":205.42,"text":"We need justice at the door."},{"s":206.14,"e":209.42,"text":"Earth is wounded, but she stands,"},{"s":209.64,"e":213.04,"text":"Waiting on the better plans,"},{"s":213.04,"e":216.08,"text":"If the world is breaking, understand:"},{"s":216.08,"e":218,"text":"God gave us hearts,"},{"s":218,"e":219.56,"text":"Earth gave us land,"},{"s":219.56,"e":223.32,"text":"Now we still got hands."},{"s":223.24,"e":226.74,"text":"Still got hands for the hungry,"},{"s":226.74,"e":233.18,"text":"Still got hands for the sea,"},{"s":233.18,"e":236.7,"text":"Still got hands for tomorrow,"},{"s":243.6,"e":248.68,"text":"Still got hands to be free."}],"duration":249.72,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-06-17T12:24:27.167Z","stats":{"whisperWords":521,"polishedWords":468,"matched":453,"matchRate":0.968}}